      "name": "Dominate — 3 Advanced — Far Mastery",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Spend a Willpower Trait and win a normal Mental Challenge against a familiar target, regardless of distance, to establish mental contact as though eye contact had been made. Once contact is established, Dominate may be used on the subject normally; using this against another supernatural being costs an additional Willpower Trait.</p>",
